[[Gedrel of Ascalon]] is a Vanguard Herald, whose functions include those of a [[historian]] and a [[hero skill trainer]]. He is attached to the [[Ebon Vanguard]].

Gedrel gives out empty [[Hero's Handbook]]s and [[Master Dungeon Guide]]s (both [[normal mode]] and [[hard mode]] versions) to characters. He also accepts filled books and gives the appropriate Ebon Vanguard rewards for them.

