==Dialogue==
''"Hail, <Character name>. [[Ascalon]] needs the help of any willing hand we can find, and if you lend your skills to the cause, your reputation will increase among the [[Ebon Vanguard]]. More, if you provide me with written evidence of what you have done in Ascalon's name, I'll tell other members of the Vanguard about your glorious deeds.''

''"If you increase your reputation enough, you can even earn [[Hero skill point]]s, which you can spend to teach your [[Hero]]es new skills."''
{{ask|gold}} '''For Ascalon! How exactly do I increase my reputation, though?'''
:''"Any time you see members of the Ebon Vanguard, offer to lend them assistance. We all have to pull together if we're ever going to defeat the [[Charr]]. Helping out the '''Vanguard Reserves''', those members who remain behind to safeguard the Eye of the North, is especially useful.''

:''"Also, keep notes; written evidence of your deeds goes a long way toward improving your reputation around here, believe me."''
::{{ask|gold}} '''Written evidence?''' (same as below)

:(after attaining rank 10 on the Vanguard title track)
:''"I salute you! You are one of the most honored members of the Vanguard! Excellent job."''
:{{ask|gold}} '''I'm interested in skills for my heroes.'''
